00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.270 align:start position:0%
 
okay  um my name is captain christine buest  it's k-r-i-s-t-i-n-e  last name is b-u-i-s-t  i'm the southeast area command captain  today i'm here to brief you on an  incident that we had in the close  proximity to the high school here  at approximately 11 o'clock this morning  school police received a report that  there was a small fire on the campus  here at the high school  as a precaution they evacuated the  students and staff from the high school  while the fire was dealt with  they then were able to escort the  students and staff back inside  at approximately 11 43 hours  lvpd dispatch received multiple phone  calls for  shots fired heard in the area  as well as a potential victim  lvmpd units responded to the area and  quickly located a scene  the scene is near the school however it  did not occur on school property  no victims were initially located in the  area  and units began canvassing for witnesses  victims or any video that may have been  available  while units were on scene they began  receiving calls from a local hospital  that there were victims that were being  dropped off with gunshot wounds  units responded to the hospital and were  able to determine that there are three  victims  the victims are being treated at that  hospital  two have been determined to be victim or  i apologize to be students at the school  this is currently being investigated by  the lvmpd gang unit in conjunction with  clark county school police  we're still in the process of  investigating  obviously this is very very preliminary  and we have just started the  investigation so i don't have any  additional information on that so you  have three shooting victims and two are  students  three victims two are confirmed to be  students here through school police have  they given you any info on whether these  are life-threatening injuries they're  being treated at local hospitals i don't  have any updated information on the  status would it be inaccurate to call  this a school shooting it did not occur  on school property  um we do not believe that the the fire  incident is going to be related to this  however it did give the opportunity that  they were off campus when they were  evacuated  okay  three victims two are students is one an  adult  i i don't have any additional on the  third victim okay okay thank you

